build, but wasn't quite "no debug" either.  A couple of shared libraries
needed by libxul.so were built, but not included in the installer
package.  Manually copying the libraries from the build hierarchy into
the root of the installed firefox solved the immediate problem, but I
got a segfault on invocation.  Frankly, I have no faith that the build
was clean, so I've restarted it after doing a "gmake -f client.mk
